<div class="space-y-4">
  <%= framework_heading(4, 'The paint half of the runtime') %>
  <p class="<%= framework_section_description_classes %>">
    The same <code class="<%= framework_section_code_classes %>">plugins.js</code> that runs these engines also
    ships TRMNLPaint, the framework's public paint API. It reads the live cascade and returns canonical Fill,
    BorderFill, and TypeSpec objects, so a plugin can resolve framework colors from JavaScript while the engines
    handle layout. See <%= render DocsRef.new(page: :paint_api) %>.
  </p>
</div>
